sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant G as Gateway
  participant P as Processor
  participant D as Data Store
  U->>G: Submit request
  G->>G: Validate & authorise
  G->>P: Dispatch task
  P->>D: Retrieve context
  D-->>P: Return records
  P->>P: Process & reason
  P-->>G: Result + metadata
  G-->>U: Response (with provenance)